        "link": "https://www.lemonde.fr/international/live/2026/03/18/en-direct-guerre-au-moyen-orient-le-guide-supreme-iranien-mojtaba-khamenei-promet-de-venger-la-mort-d-ali-larijani_6671147_3210.html",
